<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $66-7/8 (FIM 326.32).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS UP AT $66-7/8 (FIM 326.32).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed up $2 at $66-7/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 326.32 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Friday, Nokia A closed up 16.50 or more than five percent at 324.00 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed up $2-1/4 at $38 on Wall Street. The price equals about 92.71 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up five markka at 90.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended $1 higher at $20-1/2 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>The price equals to about 100.03 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 3.50 markka at 100.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
